"+same+sort+as+last+time&field0-0-0=noop&type0-0-0=noop&value0-0-0="
"\">bugzilla</a>. Okular 0.15 is a recommended update for everyone using "
"Okular."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file: news.rdf:16
